{"id": "site-toc", "ok": true, "text": "```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"《雪月》Snowmoon 非官方中译本目录。选择章节，阅读 Vitalik Buterin 的太阳朋克科幻作品。\">\n  <title>目录 · 雪月 Snowmoon 中译本</title>\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"{{SITE_URL}}toc.html\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}style.css\">\n  <script src=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}reader.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body data-page=\"toc\">\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">跳转到章节目录</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"site-container\">\n      <nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"站点导航\">\n        <a class=\"back-link\" href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span> 返回主页\n        </a>\n        <span class=\"site-name\">雪月 <span lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</span></span>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main-content\" class=\"site-container toc-page\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <header class=\"page-heading\">\n      <p class=\"eyebrow\">雪月 · 非官方中译本</p>\n      <h1 id=\"toc-title\">目录</h1>\n      <p class=\"book-stats\">全书 {{CHAPTER_COUNT}} 章 · {{TOTAL_WORDS}} 汉字</p>\n      <p id=\"toc-progress\" class=\"reading-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-atomic=\"true\">选择一章开始阅读；启用 JavaScript 后，可在此查看本机保存的阅读进度。</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <!--\n      构建条目结构约定：\n      li[data-chapter] > a.chapter-link[href]\n      链接内依次为 .chapter-title-zh、.chapter-title-en[lang=\"en\"]、\n      .chapter-dateline（地点与日期）、.chapter-status（供 JS 填充）。\n      JS 在当前章链接上设置 aria-current=\"location\"，状态同时以文字呈现。\n      .toc-list 使用响应式网格：宽屏三列、窄屏单列，保持章号的 DOM 顺序。\n    -->\n    <ol id=\"toc-list\" class=\"toc-list\" aria-labelledby=\"toc-title\">\n      {{TOC_ITEMS}}\n    </ol>\n\n    <nav class=\"toc-actions\" aria-label=\"阅读导航\">\n      <a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"read/chapter-01.html\">开始阅读 · 第一章</a>\n      <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\">返回主页</a>\n    </nav>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"site-container\">\n      <nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"项目与反馈\">\n        <a href=\"{{REPO_URL}}\">GitHub 仓库</a>\n        <a href=\"{{REPO_URL}}/issues\">报告问题 / 提出建议</a>\n        <a href=\"mailto:{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}\">{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}</a>\n      </nav>\n      <p>原作 <a href=\"{{UPSTREAM_URL}}\" lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</a>，作者 <span lang=\"en\">Vitalik Buterin</span>。本站为非官方中文译本，与原作者无隶属关系。</p>\n      <p>许可：<a href=\"{{REPO_URL}}/blob/main/LICENSE\">GPL-3.0-only</a> · 构建日期：<time datetime=\"{{BUILD_DATE}}\">{{BUILD_DATE}}</time></p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```"}
{"id": "site-index", "ok": true, "text": "```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Vitalik Buterin 科幻作品《雪月》非官方中文译本。32 章，约 14.6 万汉字，56 幅中文重绘插图；支持中英对照、深色模式、分页阅读与本地进度记忆。\">\n  <title>{{SITE_TITLE}} · 雪月 Snowmoon</title>\n  <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"{{SITE_URL}}\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}style.css\">\n  <script src=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}reader.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"home-page\" data-page=\"home\">\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main-content\">跳到主要内容</a>\n\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"site-shell site-header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"site-brand\" href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\" aria-label=\"雪月中译 · 主页\">\n        <span class=\"site-brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">◒</span>\n        <span>雪月中译</span>\n      </a>\n      <span class=\"site-edition\">非官方中文译本</span>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main-content\" class=\"site-shell home-main\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n    <section class=\"home-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"book-title\">\n      <div class=\"hero-heading\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">VITALIK BUTERIN · 科幻小说</p>\n        <h1 id=\"book-title\" class=\"book-title\">雪月 <span lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</span></h1>\n        <p class=\"book-subtitle\">在城邦、密码与语言之间，阅读另一种未来。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hero-introduction\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">关于这本书</h2>\n        <p>\n          《雪月》是 Vitalik Buterin 创作的一部带有太阳朋克色彩的英文科幻小说。\n          故事中的城邦维里迪亚（<span lang=\"en\">Veridia</span>）、密码学投票、\n          手表终端与虚构语言 <span class=\"dz-script\" lang=\"en\">Dzegoban</span>，\n          共同构成了一个值得缓慢探索的未来世界。\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          这里收录已完成的中文译本，共 {{CHAPTER_COUNT}} 章、{{TOTAL_WORDS}} 汉字，\n          配有 56 幅中文重绘插图，并保留故事中的模拟手表与终端界面。\n          本站是<strong>非官方译本，未经原作者审定</strong>；对译文有疑问时，欢迎对照英文原文。\n        </p>\n\n        <ul class=\"book-facts\" aria-label=\"译本概况\">\n          <li><strong>{{CHAPTER_COUNT}}</strong><span>章完整译文</span></li>\n          <li><strong>{{TOTAL_WORDS}}</strong><span>汉字</span></li>\n          <li><strong>56</strong><span>幅中文重绘插图</span></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <nav class=\"reading-actions\" aria-label=\"开始或继续阅读\">\n          <a class=\"button button-primary\" href=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}../read/chapter-01.html\">\n            开始阅读\n            <span class=\"button-detail\">第一章</span>\n          </a>\n          <a\n            id=\"continue-reading\"\n            class=\"button button-secondary\"\n            href=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}../read/chapter-01.html\"\n            hidden\n          >继续阅读</a>\n        </nav>\n\n        <p class=\"toc-entry\">\n          <a class=\"text-link\" href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">查看目录 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n          <span class=\"muted\">自由选择章节，每章都有独立链接。</span>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"reading-features\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\">\n      <header class=\"section-heading\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">为长篇阅读留出空间</p>\n        <h2 id=\"features-title\">按你的习惯阅读</h2>\n        <p>默认中文单栏。进入正文后，可在「阅读设置」中调整排版与阅读方式。</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <div class=\"feature-grid\">\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <h3>中文、英文与对照</h3>\n          <p>\n            随时切换中文、English 或中英对照。空间充足时，英文在左、中文在右，\n            两栏独立滚动，也可开启按进度同步；空间不足时自动切为中文与英文标签页。\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <h3>纸张底色，也有深夜灯光</h3>\n          <p>\n            羊皮纸、浅色、深色与夜间护眼主题，搭配五档字号、三档行距，\n            以及宋体和黑体两套系统字体。首次使用时，主题会参考系统的深色偏好。\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <h3>向下滚动，或左右翻页</h3>\n          <p>\n            默认上下滚动，也可切换左右分页。正文提供上一章、下一章和快捷目录；\n            点击正文中部可收起菜单，让注意力回到文字。\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"feature-card\">\n          <h3>替你留住上次的位置</h3>\n          <p>\n            章节位置与阅读设置保存在当前浏览器本地，不上传、不跨设备同步。\n            清除浏览器数据会移除记录；若本地存储不可用，仍可正常阅读。\n          </p>\n        </article>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"reading-note\">\n        无需登录，无广告。关闭 JavaScript 后，仍可阅读完整中文正文，并通过目录与章节链接浏览全书。\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"feedback-card card card-accent\" aria-labelledby=\"feedback-title\">\n      <header class=\"section-heading\">\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\">项目公开维护 · 欢迎反馈</p>\n        <h2 id=\"feedback-title\">来源与反馈</h2>\n        <p>发现错译、漏字、插图问题或阅读故障？欢迎报告 bug，也欢迎提出建议。</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <dl class=\"contact-list\">\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <dt>GitHub 仓库位置</dt>\n          <dd>\n            <a href=\"{{REPO_URL}}\">{{REPO_URL}}</a>\n            <p>译文、站点代码与译制流水线在此开源维护。</p>\n          </dd>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <dt>报告 bug / 提交建议</dt>\n          <dd>\n            <a class=\"button button-secondary\" href=\"{{REPO_URL}}/issues\">前往 GitHub Issues</a>\n            <p>请尽量附上章节链接、问题描述，以及使用的设备和浏览器；截图也很有帮助。</p>\n          </dd>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"contact-item\">\n          <dt>邮件联系</dt>\n          <dd>\n            <a href=\"mailto:{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}\">{{CONTACT_EMAIL}}</a>\n            <p>不方便使用 GitHub 时，可直接通过邮件反馈。</p>\n          </dd>\n        </div>\n      </dl>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"license-section\" aria-labelledby=\"license-title\">\n      <h2 id=\"license-title\">版权、许可与免责声明</h2>\n      <p>\n        原作 <cite lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</cite> 的作者为 Vitalik Buterin，\n        原文公开发布于\n        <a href=\"{{UPSTREAM_URL}}\">{{UPSTREAM_URL}}</a>，\n        采用 <strong>GPL-3.0-only</strong> 许可。\n        本中文译本同样遵循 GPL-3.0-only，译制流水线也在\n        <a href=\"{{REPO_URL}}\">项目仓库</a>中开源。\n        转载、修改或分发时，请遵守许可要求并保留相关版权与许可声明。\n      </p>\n      <p>\n        本项目为独立制作的非官方翻译，与原作者不存在官方合作或背书关系，\n        译文未经原作者审定。翻译及图中文字可能存在疏漏；理解有分歧时，请参考英文原作。\n        本站的介绍与译注不代表原作者意见。\n      </p>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"site-shell site-footer-inner\">\n      <p>雪月中译 · <span lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</span></p>\n      <p>构建日期：<span>{{BUILD_DATE}}</span></p>\n      <p>站点地址：<a href=\"{{SITE_URL}}\">{{SITE_URL}}</a></p>\n      <a class=\"back-to-top\" href=\"#main-content\">返回页首 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↑</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n```"}
{"id": "site-chapter", "ok": true, "text": "```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\"\n      data-theme=\"paper\"\n      data-lang-mode=\"zh\"\n      data-dual-layout=\"columns\"\n      data-active-pane=\"zh\"\n      data-page-mode=\"scroll\"\n      data-ui=\"visible\"\n      data-font=\"serif\"\n      style=\"--reader-size:20px; --reader-leading:1.8\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"《雪月》非官方中文译本 · {{CHAPTER_TITLE_ZH}}。支持中文、英文与双语对照阅读。原作 Snowmoon，作者 Vitalik Buterin。\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <title>{{CHAPTER_TITLE_ZH}} · {{CHAPTER_TITLE_EN}} — 雪月 Snowmoon</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}style.css\">\n  <link rel=\"home\" href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\">\n  <link rel=\"contents\" href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">\n  <link rel=\"prev\" href=\"{{PREV_HREF}}\">\n  <link rel=\"next\" href=\"{{NEXT_HREF}}\">\n  <script src=\"{{ASSET_PREFIX}}reader.js\" defer></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"reader-page\" data-page=\"read\" data-chapter=\"{{CHAPTER_NO}}\">\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#reader-main\">跳到正文</a>\n\n  <header id=\"topbar\" class=\"reader-topbar\">\n    <nav class=\"reader-topbar__navigation\" aria-label=\"阅读导航\">\n      <a class=\"reader-brand\" href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\" aria-label=\"雪月，返回主页\">\n        雪月 <span lang=\"en\">Snowmoon</span>\n      </a>\n      <span class=\"reader-topbar__chapter\">{{CHAPTER_TITLE_ZH}}</span>\n      <a href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">目录页</a>\n      <button id=\"btn-drawer\"\n              class=\"js-only\"\n              type=\"button\"\n              aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"\n              aria-controls=\"drawer\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\">章节目录</button>\n      <button id=\"btn-lang\"\n              class=\"js-only\"\n              type=\"button\"\n              aria-label=\"语言：中文；切换至 English\">中文</button>\n      <button id=\"btn-settings\"\n              class=\"js-only\"\n              type=\"button\"\n              aria-haspopup=\"dialog\"\n              aria-controls=\"settings-panel\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\">阅读设置</button>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"reader-progress-track\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div id=\"progress-bar\" style=\"width:0%\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <header class=\"chapter-heading\" aria-labelledby=\"chapter-heading-title\">\n    <p class=\"chapter-heading__eyebrow\">雪月 · 非官方中文译本</p>\n    <h1 id=\"chapter-heading-title\">{{CHAPTER_TITLE_ZH}}</h1>\n    <p class=\"chapter-heading__english\" lang=\"en\">{{CHAPTER_TITLE_EN}}</p>\n    <p class=\"chapter-heading__dateline\">{{CHAPTER_DATELINE_ZH}}</p>\n    <p class=\"chapter-heading__dateline chapter-heading__dateline--en\" lang=\"en\">{{CHAPTER_DATELINE_EN}}</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div id=\"lang-tabs\"\n       class=\"language-tabs\"\n       role=\"tablist\"\n       aria-label=\"对照阅读语言\"\n       aria-orientation=\"horizontal\">\n    <button id=\"tab-zh\"\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            data-tab-lang=\"zh\"\n            aria-controls=\"pane-zh\"\n            aria-selected=\"true\"\n            tabindex=\"0\">中文</button>\n    <button id=\"tab-en\"\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            data-tab-lang=\"en\"\n            aria-controls=\"pane-en\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n            tabindex=\"-1\"\n            lang=\"en\">English</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <noscript>\n    <p class=\"reader-notice\">\n      当前为中文滚动阅读。阅读设置、进度记忆和双语切换需要 JavaScript；\n      正文与章节链接仍可正常使用。\n    </p>\n  </noscript>\n\n  <main id=\"reader-main\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"章节正文\">\n    <div class=\"reader\">\n      <section id=\"pane-zh\"\n               class=\"reader-pane reader-pane--zh\"\n               data-lang=\"zh\"\n               lang=\"zh-CN\"\n               aria-label=\"中文译文\"\n               tabindex=\"0\">\n        <div id=\"viewport-zh\" class=\"reader-viewport\">\n          <div id=\"flow-zh\" class=\"reader-flow\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-content\" data-lang=\"zh\">\n              {{CONTENT_ZH}}\n            </div>\n\n            <nav id=\"chapter-nav\" class=\"chapter-navigation\" aria-label=\"中文正文章末导航\">\n              <a id=\"nav-prev\" class=\"chapter-navigation__prev\" href=\"{{PREV_HREF}}\">{{PREV_LABEL}}</a>\n              <a id=\"nav-toc\" class=\"chapter-navigation__toc\" href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">返回目录</a>\n              <a id=\"nav-next\" class=\"chapter-navigation__next\" href=\"{{NEXT_HREF}}\">{{NEXT_LABEL}}</a>\n            </nav>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <section id=\"pane-en\"\n               class=\"reader-pane reader-pane--en\"\n               data-lang=\"en\"\n               lang=\"en\"\n               aria-label=\"英文原文\"\n               tabindex=\"0\">\n        <div id=\"viewport-en\" class=\"reader-viewport\">\n          <div id=\"flow-en\" class=\"reader-flow\">\n            <div class=\"chapter-content\" data-lang=\"en\">\n              {{CONTENT_EN}}\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"chapter-navigation\"\n                 aria-label=\"英文正文章末导航\"\n                 lang=\"zh-CN\">\n              <a class=\"chapter-navigation__prev\" href=\"{{PREV_HREF}}\">{{PREV_LABEL}}</a>\n              <a class=\"chapter-navigation__toc\" href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">返回目录</a>\n              <a class=\"chapter-navigation__next\" href=\"{{NEXT_HREF}}\">{{NEXT_LABEL}}</a>\n            </nav>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <footer id=\"bottombar\" class=\"reader-bottombar js-only\" aria-label=\"翻屏与阅读进度\">\n    <button id=\"btn-prev-screen\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"上一屏或上一页\">上一屏</button>\n    <span id=\"page-indicator\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"off\" aria-atomic=\"true\">本章 0%</span>\n    <button id=\"btn-next-screen\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"下一屏或下一页\">下一屏</button>\n  </footer>\n\n  <aside id=\"drawer\"\n         class=\"reader-dialog reader-drawer\"\n         role=\"dialog\"\n         aria-modal=\"true\"\n         aria-label=\"目录\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"drawer-title\"\n         tabindex=\"-1\"\n         hidden>\n    <header class=\"reader-dialog__header\">\n      <h2 id=\"drawer-title\">章节目录</h2>\n      <button id=\"drawer-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭章节目录\">关闭</button>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"reader-dialog__body\">\n      <p class=\"drawer-current\">正在阅读：{{CHAPTER_TITLE_ZH}}</p>\n      <p class=\"drawer-summary\">全书 {{CHAPTER_COUNT}} 章 · <a href=\"{{TOC_HREF}}\">打开完整目录</a></p>\n      <ol id=\"drawer-toc\" class=\"toc-list toc-list--drawer\">\n        {{TOC_ITEMS}}\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n    <footer class=\"reader-dialog__footer\">\n      <a href=\"{{HOME_HREF}}\">返回主页</a>\n    </footer>\n  </aside>\n\n  <aside id=\"settings-panel\"\n         class=\"reader-dialog reader-settings\"\n         role=\"dialog\"\n         aria-modal=\"true\"\n         aria-label=\"阅读设置\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"settings-title\"\n         aria-describedby=\"settings-note\"\n         tabindex=\"-1\"\n         hidden>\n    <header class=\"reader-dialog__header\">\n      <h2 id=\"settings-title\">阅读设置</h2>\n      <button id=\"settings-close\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"关闭阅读设置\">关闭</button>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"reader-dialog__body\">\n      <p id=\"settings-note\" class=\"settings-note\">\n        设置即时生效，并尽可能保存在当前浏览器中。\n      </p>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\">\n        <legend>字号</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"size\" data-value=\"16\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"字号，小，16像素\">小 · 16</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"size\" data-value=\"18\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"字号，较小，18像素\">较小 · 18</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"size\" data-value=\"20\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"字号，标准，20像素\">标准 · 20</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"size\" data-value=\"22\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"字号，较大，22像素\">较大 · 22</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"size\" data-value=\"24\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"字号，大，24像素\">大 · 24</button>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\">\n        <legend>行距</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"leading\" data-value=\"1.7\" aria-pressed=\"false\">紧凑 · 1.7</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"leading\" data-value=\"1.8\" aria-pressed=\"true\">标准 · 1.8</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"leading\" data-value=\"1.9\" aria-pressed=\"false\">宽松 · 1.9</button>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\">\n        <legend>字体</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"font\" data-value=\"serif\" aria-pressed=\"true\">宋体</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"font\" data-value=\"sans\" aria-pressed=\"false\">黑体</button>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\">\n        <legend>主题</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"theme\" data-value=\"paper\" aria-pressed=\"true\">羊皮纸</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"theme\" data-value=\"light\" aria-pressed=\"false\">浅色</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"theme\" data-value=\"dark\" aria-pressed=\"false\">深色</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"theme\" data-value=\"night\" aria-pressed=\"false\">夜间护眼</button>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\">\n        <legend>翻页</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"mode\" data-value=\"scroll\" aria-pressed=\"true\">上下滚动</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"mode\" data-value=\"paged\" aria-pressed=\"false\">左右翻页</button>\n        </div>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\" aria-describedby=\"language-help\">\n        <legend>语言</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"lang\" data-value=\"zh\" aria-pressed=\"true\">中文</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"lang\" data-value=\"en\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span lang=\"en\">English</span><span class=\"sr-only\">，英文原文</span></button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"lang\" data-value=\"dual\" aria-pressed=\"false\">对照</button>\n        </div>\n        <p id=\"language-help\" class=\"setting-help\">\n          对照模式按可用空间自动选择左右分栏或双标签页；分栏时英文在左，中文在右。\n        </p>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <fieldset class=\"setting-group\" aria-describedby=\"sync-help\">\n        <legend>同步滚动</legend>\n        <div class=\"setting-options\">\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"sync\" data-value=\"off\" aria-pressed=\"true\">关闭</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" data-set=\"sync\" data-value=\"on\" aria-pressed=\"false\">开启</button>\n        </div>\n        <p id=\"sync-help\" class=\"setting-help\">\n          对照模式下按阅读百分比同步两种语言的位置，不逐段对齐；分页时按页码比例同步。\n        </p>\n      </fieldset>\n\n      <section class=\"reader-shortcuts\" aria-labelledby=\"shortcuts-title\">\n        <h3 id=\"shortcuts-title\">阅读操作</h3>\n        <p>点击正文左侧或右侧翻屏，点击中部显隐菜单。链接、控件、选中文字及终端内部滚动区域不触发翻屏。</p>\n        <dl>\n          <div>\n            <dt><kbd>←</kbd> / <kbd>→</kbd></dt>\n            <dd>上一屏 / 下一屏；到章首或章末继续按可切换章节</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <dt><kbd>↑</kbd> / <kbd>↓</kbd></dt>\n            <dd>滚动当前阅读栏</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <dt><kbd>Esc</kbd></dt>\n            <dd>关闭面板，或显隐菜单</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <dt><kbd>T</kbd></dt>\n            <dd>切换主题</dd>\n          </div>\n          <div>\n            <dt><kbd>D</kbd></dt>\n            <dd>切换中文、英文与对照模式</dd>\n          </div>\n        </dl>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n\n  <div id=\"scrim\" class=\"reader-scrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\" hidden></div>\n</body>\n</html>\n```"}
